/* Onboarding */
"Welcome to Doppelganger" = "欢迎使用 Doppelganger";
"A local, open-source media offload workflow for macOS." = "一款在 macOS 本地运行的开源媒体转存工具。";
"Copy. Verify every byte. Prove it." = "复制。逐字节验证。留下证据。";
"Who is operating this Mac?" = "谁正在操作这台 Mac？";
"Operator profile" = "操作员资料";
"Active operator" = "当前操作员";
"Local profiles" = "本地资料";
"Avatar" = "头像";
"Profiles are local attribution, not authenticated accounts. Historical attempts keep the name that was selected when they were created." = "资料仅用于本地操作归属，不是登录账号。历史尝试会保留创建时所选的操作员姓名。";
"This is local attribution, not a login. Each task snapshots the selected profile so history still shows who operated it after a profile is renamed." = "这是本地操作归属，不是登录。每个任务都会记录当时所选资料，即使之后改名，历史仍会显示原操作员。";
"Add more profiles and image avatars later in Settings › Profiles." = "之后可在“设置 › 资料”中添加更多操作员和图片头像。";
"Drop an image onto the avatar, or use local initials and color." = "把图片拖到头像上，或使用姓名首字母和颜色。";
"File access on macOS" = "macOS 文件访问";
"Doppelganger asks you to choose sources and destinations when they are needed. It cannot see folders that macOS has not allowed the app to access." = "Doppelganger 会在需要时请你选择来源和目的地。对于 macOS 尚未授权的文件夹，应用无法查看。";
"Automatic Camera/Card recognition is off by default. You can enable review suggestions later in Settings › Transfer; no task ever auto-starts." = "自动识别 Camera/Card 默认关闭。之后可在“设置 › 传输”中开启审阅建议；任何任务都不会自动开始。";
"Try a safe demo transfer" = "试用安全的演示传输";
"Doppelganger can create a tiny synthetic card and two empty destinations inside its own Application Support folder, then open the normal preflight review." = "Doppelganger 可以在自身的 Application Support 文件夹中创建一个小型合成卡和两个空目的地，然后打开正常的预检审阅。";

